{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳在重返公司後的首次全員大會上向員工道歉，並試圖澄清外界關於白宮和科技界領袖幫助他重新獲得職位的説法。<strong>他在會上稱，美國總統特朗普直接參與其復職的説法「完全不屬實」，並表示「不要以為政治在公司中發揮了任何作用。我們是最不涉政治的公司」。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587878.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T20:44:19.854349+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T20:30:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T20:37:33.491223+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T20:37:33.491223+00:00","content_hash":"b670a5c85e50c27a227ece9cd352b06e752671340fc0a4b603fbc7cdc2086985","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}